# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
title    Roots
composer Claude
about    The first dark under the grass, roots hanging from the ceiling and water dripping: a clarinet in D Dorian and its echo over a pizzicato ostinato that falls 3+3+2 against the bar, a fretless bass, a soft string pad and music box drips. When something is near, bodhran, woodblock and timpani take over; a horn joins the fight, choir and gong come for a guardian.
tempo    76
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.5

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead echo pizz bass pad drips
# mood treasure: pizz pad drips wonder
# mood sense:    timpani bodhran block pizz bass pad
# mood rise:     sense lead echo kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -echo -pizz -block horn drive war crash
# mood boss:     fight -lead choir gong

voice lead     clarinet  vol=0.65 pan=-0.1
voice echo     clarinet  vol=0.22 pan=0.45 rev=0.6
voice horn     horn      vol=0.70 pan=0.2 att=0.025 rel=0.12 rev=0.3 oct=-1
voice pizz     pizz      vol=0.55 pan=0.3
voice bass     fretless  vol=0.7
voice pad      strings   vol=0.24 pan=-0.25 center=A3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice drips    musicbox  vol=0.3  pan=0.5  rev=0.7
voice wonder   celesta   vol=0.38 pan=-0.35 rev=0.6
voice timpani  timpani   vol=0.55 pan=-0.1
voice bodhran  bodhran   vol=0.55 pan=-0.2
voice block    block     vol=0.35 pan=0.35
voice kick     kick      vol=0.55
voice snare    snare     vol=0.38 pan=0.1
voice crash    crash     vol=0.28 pan=0.2
voice choir    voices    vol=0.3  center=D3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice gong     gong      vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

# Combat-only motion: tight low ostinato and accented battle drums, at the same tempo.
voice drive    pizz      vol=0.58 pan=0.3 gate=0.55 rev=0.25
voice war      tommid    vol=0.52 pan=0.15 rev=0.2

